  "clips": [
    {
      "text": "Moi, c'est Gaston Darroux. Mais appelle-moi Gabi. Quarante ans de rugby dans le Sud-Ouest : pilier, puis entraîneur. J'ai gardé les oreilles et le carnet.",
      "textSha256": "bc335649fed7dac3b875fb2b54d28de1fe0508c264db6de7d74e523bc5571272",
      "sha256": "af36d3d538113ee416b668d9802f2e5b7659637ec2b815a9c50b538972561338",
      "file": "bienvenue-01.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 12.88,
      "sampleRate": 24000,
      "channels": 1,
      "generationSeconds": 0,
      "peakBeforeNormalization": 0.7109375,
      "seed": 271108,
      "generationMethod": "Original VoiceDesign synthetic reference, exact same text",
      "id": "bienvenue-01",
      "pageId": "bienvenue",
      "segmentIndex": 1,
      "text_sha256": "bc335649fed7dac3b875fb2b54d28de1fe0508c264db6de7d74e523bc5571272"
    },
    {
      "text": "Ici, c'est toi qui entraînes ; moi, je t'aide à trouver tes repères. On fera les choses sérieusement, sans oublier de se régaler. Allez, bienvenue au club !",
      "textSha256": "54d2c3e82b3b388f1b287f12b868aeb24f6b3dfed3eb594888adbb49494ea71f",
      "sha256": "a7608da587477fa245195da41fca4cf897fe9997fe1c86d2570d66b44fa94018",
      "file": "bienvenue-02.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 10.88,
      "sampleRate": 24000,
      "channels": 1,
      "generationSeconds": 16.76,
      "peakBeforeNormalization": 0.796875,
      "seed": 271108,
      "id": "bienvenue-02",
      "pageId": "bienvenue",
      "segmentIndex": 2,
      "text_sha256": "54d2c3e82b3b388f1b287f12b868aeb24f6b3dfed3eb594888adbb49494ea71f"
    },
    {
      "text": "Choisir un club, c'est choisir les gens avec qui on va vivre la saison. Regarde la division et l'objectif avant de prendre les rênes.",
      "textSha256": "49d595cd2e65513931e3caa0b514560d97a6d036db5055aeeca0039f9f32d93e",
      "sha256": "3bd4e788581bec2ee1825db97939920415d9e3d67934f3acbacf9cf15dda13ad",
      "file": "club-01.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 9.36,
      "sampleRate": 24000,
      "channels": 1,
      "generationSeconds": 13.64,
      "peakBeforeNormalization": 0.73046875,
      "seed": 271108,
      "id": "club-01",
      "pageId": "club",
      "segmentIndex": 1,
      "text_sha256": "49d595cd2e65513931e3caa0b514560d97a6d036db5055aeeca0039f9f32d93e"
    },
    {
      "text": "La base anonymisée permet de jouer tout de suite. Et si tu remplaces une carrière, lis bien la confirmation : on ne range pas une histoire sans savoir où on la met.",
      "textSha256": "392c315be0bcbbecbe0505d715789930402ab55cf6d1490fb597a58c53572bea",
      "sha256": "151b2d4f512a144a62038d308529f957b826358ac986be0bb5c3f494eb4674a2",
      "file": "club-02.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 9.76,
      "sampleRate": 24000,
      "channels": 1,
      "generationSeconds": 16.31,
      "peakBeforeNormalization": 0.70703125,
      "seed": 271108,
      "id": "club-02",
      "pageId": "club",
      "segmentIndex": 2,
      "text_sha256": "392c315be0bcbbecbe0505d715789930402ab55cf6d1490fb597a58c53572bea"
    },
    {
      "text": "Viens, on pose le carnet. D'abord la prochaine rencontre, puis les décisions qui attendent. Les raccourcis t'emmènent directement au bon endroit.",
      "textSha256": "f07cd0164ced0ad7879d89507be9a707eaf25e5d2915f822731d87757fab6f94",
      "sha256": "276b2cb698b29f7e096b29b8feda604fe91aa628d9e7270a35a827405ce78520",
      "file": "bureau-01.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 8.56,
      "sampleRate": 24000,
      "channels": 1,
      "generationSeconds": 13.74,
      "peakBeforeNormalization": 0.73046875,
      "seed": 271108,
      "id": "bureau-01",
      "pageId": "bureau",
      "segmentIndex": 1,
      "text_sha256": "f07cd0164ced0ad7879d89507be9a707eaf25e5d2915f822731d87757fab6f94"
    },
    {
      "text": "La carrière se sauvegarde toute seule ; le menu permet aussi d'en garder une copie. Mon vieux conseil : une chose après l'autre. Le club ne se construit pas en une matinée.",
      "textSha256": "c4f47a25ca9098f36128cb95438a741bf4b0fb03df5f4b0caef2dbf7a2782849",
      "sha256": "167b971c56215173e9f4512c373acec20b8029dca089721677e0ba73514f7799",
      "file": "bureau-02.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 11.12,
      "sampleRate": 24000,
      "channels": 1,
      "generationSeconds": 16.12,
      "peakBeforeNormalization": 0.84765625,
      "seed": 271108,
      "id": "bureau-02",
      "pageId": "bureau",
      "segmentIndex": 2,
      "text_sha256": "c4f47a25ca9098f36128cb95438a741bf4b0fb03df5f4b0caef2dbf7a2782849"
    },
    {
      "text": "Avant de parler de tactique, connais ton groupe. Poste, condition, disponibilité : commence par là, puis ouvre une fiche. Un bon joueur fatigué reste un joueur fatigué.",
      "textSha256": "a023827a0415f7092b591bed76813f0e0eecdcd444f9c9d63fb436d36dfc1e1b",
      "sha256": "7c246c7893cb5b6ab38ff32441886e1bb29f8825ae2a93fc8a64990ef49cd369",
      "file": "effectif-01.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 12.0,
      "sampleRate": 24000,
      "channels": 1,
      "generationSeconds": 17.87,
      "peakBeforeNormalization": 0.6796875,
      "seed": 271108,
      "id": "effectif-01",
      "pageId": "effectif",
      "segmentIndex": 1,
      "text_sha256": "a023827a0415f7092b591bed76813f0e0eecdcd444f9c9d63fb436d36dfc1e1b"
    },
    {
      "text": "Les filtres t'aident à repérer blessés et joueurs hors groupe. Ne regarde pas seulement les quinze premiers : la saison se gagne avec tout le monde.",
      "textSha256": "7620dc54e933ad44c0e1b4cbaa40565452e109ea441bdb407bdd0f7d7820f7f7",
      "sha256": "8910ff523ef63ac7236ec2079ce3cb9133480e42d7c6a221a84d3973fbbce3fd",
      "file": "effectif-02.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 8.72,
      "sampleRate": 24000,
      "channels": 1,
      "generationSeconds": 11.82,
      "peakBeforeNormalization": 0.71484375,
      "seed": 271108,
      "id": "effectif-02",
      "pageId": "effectif",
      "segmentIndex": 2,
      "text_sha256": "7620dc54e933ad44c0e1b4cbaa40565452e109ea441bdb407bdd0f7d7820f7f7"
    },
    {
      "text": "La première ligne, j'y ai laissé quelques oreilles : on ne bricole pas ses qualifications. Choisis un poste, regarde les joueurs autorisés et prépare aussi le banc.",
      "textSha256": "3b78ade3c975e57d8ac7bf42ff3df02224058db5e4bd75a5a3264ca6dc569175",
      "sha256": "0f184c07e3f4d5866ed71693683eb17d28fa450251a5bba0aa03274d8e009666",
      "file": "composition-01.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 10.32,
      "sampleRate": 24000,
      "channels": 1,
      "generationSeconds": 16.08,
      "peakBeforeNormalization": 0.80078125,
      "seed": 271108,
      "id": "composition-01",
      "pageId": "composition",
      "segmentIndex": 1,
      "text_sha256": "3b78ade3c975e57d8ac7bf42ff3df02224058db5e4bd75a5a3264ca6dc569175"
    },
    {
      "text": "Vérifie toute la feuille avant de partir. Pendant le match, les changements se feront dans l'onglet Banc, en pause. Et le dernier mot reste le tien.",
      "textSha256": "291a060cb58c29a16c5de0737c24da7150738d73230bee4cc19937fce4fed734",
      "sha256": "354ab87c1dc0863e159b6af9aaf668d84dc9725c282fedc69edcae7e6c2f758b",
      "file": "composition-02.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 9.76,
      "sampleRate": 24000,
      "channels": 1,
      "generationSeconds": 18.98,
      "peakBeforeNormalization": 0.65234375,
      "seed": 271108,
      "id": "composition-02",
      "pageId": "composition",
      "segmentIndex": 2,
      "listeningReviewNote": "Banc transcribed banque by both Whisper variants. May reflect ASR lexical prior or pronunciation; human listening not confirmed.",
      "text_sha256": "291a060cb58c29a16c5de0737c24da7150738d73230bee4cc19937fce4fed734"
    },
    {
      "text": "Faire transpirer tout le monde, c'est facile. Faire progresser le groupe sans le mettre à plat, voilà le métier.",
      "textSha256": "804b43cee33d89200bc3623468040fed627bc08cd2750338a7ab3582c97c46b8",
      "sha256": "1cce88e19ba5b8d6c3de3fb84626bbfd16b5051b3488bac89ba7428fdb076196",
      "file": "entrainement-01.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 7.44,
      "sampleRate": 24000,
      "channels": 1,
      "generationSeconds": 14.14,
      "peakBeforeNormalization": 0.80859375,
      "seed": 271108,
      "id": "entrainement-01",
      "pageId": "entrainement",
      "segmentIndex": 1,
      "text_sha256": "804b43cee33d89200bc3623468040fed627bc08cd2750338a7ab3582c97c46b8"
    },
    {
      "text": "Regarde la condition et la charge avant de choisir récupération, normal ou intensif. Une séance collective par semaine : une fois faite, elle est faite.",
      "textSha256": "c1be3baff5ea6393e2849f9d578e756a32dd88fa39f13449493946b83fd2121e",
      "sha256": "a241e6f21a49517d3453bf7f08704fe9e62837c00dae7f3e4d1e0fa69fe7aab3",
      "file": "entrainement-02.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 10.4,
      "sampleRate": 24000,
      "channels": 1,
      "generationSeconds": 16.46,
      "peakBeforeNormalization": 0.765625,
      "seed": 271108,
      "id": "entrainement-02",
      "pageId": "entrainement",
      "segmentIndex": 2,
      "text_sha256": "c1be3baff5ea6393e2849f9d578e756a32dd88fa39f13449493946b83fd2121e"
    },
    {
      "text": "Prépare-la avant le coup d'envoi, avec le prochain match en tête.",
      "textSha256": "c6bd35b4604e66f6f6b5ae671c1ca15ac0f05384177d202711f475feb6e51c90",
      "sha256": "8f1997227b0fee16ba2ee5a8b47753e7305da14519c683e75da6f0093f901c5f",
      "file": "entrainement-03.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 4.08,
      "sampleRate": 24000,
      "channels": 1,
      "generationSeconds": 7.31,
      "peakBeforeNormalization": 0.734375,
      "seed": 271108,
      "id": "entrainement-03",
      "pageId": "entrainement",
      "segmentIndex": 3,
      "text_sha256": "c6bd35b4604e66f6f6b5ae671c1ca15ac0f05384177d202711f475feb6e51c90"
    },
    {
      "text": "Un plan, il faut pouvoir l'expliquer simplement. Lis le dossier adverse, puis choisis ton attaque et ta défense. Le conseil du staff donne des raisons, pas une recette miracle.",
      "textSha256": "b4e717f8166390fa98804920f9c7aa0c82cfbef745f8038302d0e256f54e2164",
      "sha256": "29bc86b73a002eabc658e0255e9fa1617f3793b3b9cf4e07b7bf1103fd17e26a",
      "file": "tactique-01.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 11.84,
      "sampleRate": 24000,
      "channels": 1,
      "generationSeconds": 19.25,
      "peakBeforeNormalization": 0.7421875,
      "seed": 271108,
      "id": "tactique-01",
      "pageId": "tactique",
      "segmentIndex": 1,
      "text_sha256": "b4e717f8166390fa98804920f9c7aa0c82cfbef745f8038302d0e256f54e2164"
    },
    {
      "text": "Regarde aussi qui peut réellement jouer. Tu pourras ajuster tes consignes en pause ; on s'adapte à ce qu'on voit, pas à ce qu'on espérait.",
      "textSha256": "75d905c9b209a5e4344788bc7d89929fd399ab8e680897f57f0e5ce1f564dd28",
      "sha256": "53ed95a99cb2220d39f1c7dca6629174eec1872cd565c20dc88b882e47766bd9",
      "file": "tactique-02.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 8.56,
      "sampleRate": 24000,
      "channels": 1,
      "generationSeconds": 18.0,
      "peakBeforeNormalization": 0.7890625,
      "seed": 271108,
      "id": "tactique-02",
      "pageId": "tactique",
      "segmentIndex": 2,
      "text_sha256": "75d905c9b209a5e4344788bc7d89929fd399ab8e680897f57f0e5ce1f564dd28"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bon. La feuille, les consignes, un dernier regard au banc… et coup d'envoi. Direct pour suivre, Banc pour changer, Stats pour prendre du recul.",
      "textSha256": "fd751f2db43a243f9710f8432532fab8748ae6d4cf58a088c79f43b84d715cc4",
      "sha256": "4c9a7021523999080b2ab5f45d9a3d3ed051d1d25277bdd781542d9ae36a01cc",
      "file": "premier-match-01.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 11.52,
      "sampleRate": 24000,
      "channels": 1,
      "generationSeconds": 17.02,
      "peakBeforeNormalization": 0.9140625,
      "seed": 271108,
      "id": "premier-match-01",
      "pageId": "premier-match",
      "segmentIndex": 1,
      "text_sha256": "fd751f2db43a243f9710f8432532fab8748ae6d4cf58a088c79f43b84d715cc4"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mets en pause quand tu veux décider tranquillement. Maintenant je te laisse le terrain. Je peux être bavard, mais je sais aussi me taire quand le ballon vit.",
      "textSha256": "3e3af9b62e3517d9a1fe29430dadd2529326420f76e2894714f76dcbb6ac6361",
      "sha256": "b51dcee40a976e73a9e770a51c724c562a1a2cd3a52de2183baacdb25c0ad7c0",
      "file": "premier-match-02.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 10.16,
      "sampleRate": 24000,
      "channels": 1,
      "generationSeconds": 14.56,
      "peakBeforeNormalization": 0.7109375,
      "seed": 271108,
      "id": "premier-match-02",
      "pageId": "premier-match",
      "segmentIndex": 2,
      "text_sha256": "3e3af9b62e3517d9a1fe29430dadd2529326420f76e2894714f76dcbb6ac6361"
    },
    {
      "text": "Le résultat est là. Gagné ou perdu, on prend le temps de comprendre. Regarde la conquête, la discipline et la réussite au but, puis les moments du match.",
      "textSha256": "cca38c12da2b9fe19e76a1ef09e666405b721e75781795009f84222524d1caa4",
      "sha256": "20e4ce7f73760717a13788b91ce2209520bbcc020090dde48d51d476358cb9e6",
      "file": "resultat-01.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 10.72,
      "sampleRate": 24000,
      "channels": 1,
      "generationSeconds": 17.96,
      "peakBeforeNormalization": 0.828125,
      "seed": 271108,
      "id": "resultat-01",
      "pageId": "resultat",
      "segmentIndex": 1,
      "text_sha256": "cca38c12da2b9fe19e76a1ef09e666405b721e75781795009f84222524d1caa4"
    },
    {
      "text": "Les chiffres donnent des pistes ; ils ne prouvent pas tout. Quand tu as fait ton bilan, valide la journée. Et demain, on retourne travailler. Sans s'emballer, sans baisser la tête.",
      "textSha256": "b72384a716b1fd6b4a913499f4cfebe4600492f3cfa1274796244b3f5c958128",
      "sha256": "e7f1d89043e84e4549158dc73e0b1fafdcb7a1d3ff762e5af5c6aae95c9ae1d0",
      "file": "resultat-02.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 11.68,
      "sampleRate": 24000,
      "channels": 1,
      "generationSeconds": 17.06,
      "peakBeforeNormalization": 0.796875,
      "seed": 271108,
      "id": "resultat-02",
      "pageId": "resultat",
      "segmentIndex": 2,
      "text_sha256": "b72384a716b1fd6b4a913499f4cfebe4600492f3cfa1274796244b3f5c958128"
    },
    {
      "text": "Une saison, c'est long. Regarde ce qui vient avant de demander encore un effort aux mêmes joueurs. Ici, tu retrouves les résultats et les rencontres à jouer.",
      "textSha256": "762d8527547f4c22610f77960e44faa7a9c35e4d35df9258d745a369088de93e",
      "sha256": "ade4aa354095731742d40de24e18ede111dfcc935e3821a9ab491a51dd4ff521",
      "file": "calendrier-01.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 10.48,
      "sampleRate": 24000,
      "channels": 1,
      "generationSeconds": 14.72,
      "peakBeforeNormalization": 0.69140625,
      "seed": 271108,
      "id": "calendrier-01",
      "pageId": "calendrier",
      "segmentIndex": 1,
      "text_sha256": "762d8527547f4c22610f77960e44faa7a9c35e4d35df9258d745a369088de93e"
    },
    {
      "text": "Les phases finales se précisent avec la compétition. Prépare le prochain rendez-vous, mais garde un œil sur celui d'après : les jambes ont une mémoire, elles aussi.",
      "textSha256": "48f093fe8006d88944348c7f412d3fb2259cd66f6e3afc4988107aee56414351",
      "sha256": "04ae94db4df425dbf196bd32941f8004de985d76f3fedda9131ea2c4b016340f",
      "file": "calendrier-02.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 10.0,
      "sampleRate": 24000,
      "channels": 1,
      "generationSeconds": 13.94,
      "peakBeforeNormalization": 0.93359375,
      "seed": 271108,
      "id": "calendrier-02",
      "pageId": "calendrier",
      "segmentIndex": 2,
      "text_sha256": "48f093fe8006d88944348c7f412d3fb2259cd66f6e3afc4988107aee56414351"
    },
    {
      "text": "Le classement, on le regarde en face. Points, matchs joués, différence : vérifie tout avant de comparer.",
      "textSha256": "3b3f64b6be08f1239c116ee73872a3f0337fd6ee720188fc206630e88541fd11",
      "sha256": "40d727f26f684ea46df9d237dadaeec6c285dcf0cbad08691067e24025b23f9d",
      "file": "classements-01.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 7.44,
      "sampleRate": 24000,
      "channels": 1,
      "generationSeconds": 12.54,
      "peakBeforeNormalization": 0.7421875,
      "seed": 271109,
      "id": "classements-01",
      "pageId": "classements",
      "segmentIndex": 1,
      "generationMethod": "Second take with unchanged text and same synthetic reference; seed 271109",
      "text_sha256": "3b3f64b6be08f1239c116ee73872a3f0337fd6ee720188fc206630e88541fd11"
    },
    {
      "text": "Les onglets montrent les deux divisions et les archives gardent les saisons terminées. Une victoire ne fait pas de nous des champions ; une défaite ne défait pas tout le travail.",
      "textSha256": "19a2a09ead462b2e1c504481e3ed49068ebbccbbda46c00570d9a428f1c06a52",
      "sha256": "0cb5ae09698d93d027e731d690c4f83552c8257d9bdb211fb6d104c4de700704",
      "file": "classements-02.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 10.56,
      "sampleRate": 24000,
      "channels": 1,
      "generationSeconds": 15.42,
      "peakBeforeNormalization": 0.765625,
      "seed": 271110,
      "id": "classements-02",
      "pageId": "classements",
      "segmentIndex": 2,
      "generationMethod": "Sentence pieces, unchanged words/punctuation; same synthetic reference; seed 271110, temperature 0.65, 160ms intersentence pauses.",
      "text_sha256": "19a2a09ead462b2e1c504481e3ed49068ebbccbbda46c00570d9a428f1c06a52"
    },
    {
      "text": "Continue à construire.",
      "textSha256": "254f3c596e5afefef03f969d0a39cd945d37ed5355a96c45acd7e1274c711490",
      "sha256": "320dfbe7dde15d93983930f3e6189dbdb5658d0ebb888faaa5429adac7ff41e4",
      "file": "classements-03.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 1.6,
      "sampleRate": 24000,
      "channels": 1,
      "generationSeconds": 2.75,
      "peakBeforeNormalization": 0.63671875,
      "seed": 271108,
      "id": "classements-03",
      "pageId": "classements",
      "segmentIndex": 3,
      "listeningReviewNote": "Whisper small writes Continuez, Whisper base writes exact Continue. Human listening not confirmed.",
      "text_sha256": "254f3c596e5afefef03f969d0a39cd945d37ed5355a96c45acd7e1274c711490"
    },
    {
      "text": "Dans mon premier club, on comptait jusqu'aux ampoules du vestiaire. Ici aussi, regarde les moyens avant de promettre.",
      "textSha256": "d6407080c422fa86600c0fb0d665e8c41747eb46d5f21df4a16fbffa48b393fe",
      "sha256": "e1b2bd7becc055fd6d94af12760fd6aa26f9504d2a3735bc39e0d648a8855ce5",
      "file": "finances-01.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 7.44,
      "sampleRate": 24000,
      "channels": 1,
      "generationSeconds": 11.31,
      "peakBeforeNormalization": 0.79296875,
      "seed": 271108,
      "id": "finances-01",
      "pageId": "finances",
      "segmentIndex": 1,
      "text_sha256": "d6407080c422fa86600c0fb0d665e8c41747eb46d5f21df4a16fbffa48b393fe"
    },
    {
      "text": "La prime se paie tout de suite, les salaires reviennent chaque semaine de jeu. Le journal garde les mouvements.",
      "textSha256": "2449947f1b68eeaed4c4f8aab4b82025a734d6f6253aab245a3d7ae152864840",
      "sha256": "ee5f485e277df3c04f1abbfd3cc2f2c95d61c076cdf29e5f4e4d5d0b1896d1e4",
      "file": "finances-02.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 6.8,
      "sampleRate": 24000,
      "channels": 1,
      "generationSeconds": 9.86,
      "peakBeforeNormalization": 0.70703125,
      "seed": 271108,
      "id": "finances-02",
      "pageId": "finances",
      "segmentIndex": 2,
      "text_sha256": "2449947f1b68eeaed4c4f8aab4b82025a734d6f6253aab245a3d7ae152864840"
    },
    {
      "text": "Ces montants sont fictifs : ils servent à gérer notre projet, pas à raconter les comptes des vrais clubs.",
      "textSha256": "a974606c2136ad01094a3d60665b7117ee1197b0cff436124a7ea93c290dba5b",
      "sha256": "2eadf1a3b42b9462c1a5762b28f6eb9d468e356fc5d0383ad7ab4466b22cf265",
      "file": "finances-03.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 6.32,
      "sampleRate": 24000,
      "channels": 1,
      "generationSeconds": 9.56,
      "peakBeforeNormalization": 0.71484375,
      "seed": 271108,
      "id": "finances-03",
      "pageId": "finances",
      "segmentIndex": 3,
      "text_sha256": "a974606c2136ad01094a3d60665b7117ee1197b0cff436124a7ea93c290dba5b"
    },
    {
      "text": "Tu peux jouer avec la base anonymisée ou importer un pack personnalisé. Lis son aperçu, installe-le, puis sélectionne-le. Les identités changent, les progrès de ta carrière restent.",
      "textSha256": "25ff5397f5210d1c8e9449b15f98530822eb48bce56496bf3de368cb5665c418",
      "sha256": "22e605328fa8ced379ed176bf7707a8bb49a6f1c0597f2e86359ec2e70b663df",
      "file": "packs-01.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 12.08,
      "sampleRate": 24000,
      "channels": 1,
      "generationSeconds": 18.83,
      "peakBeforeNormalization": 0.6875,
      "seed": 271108,
      "id": "packs-01",
      "pageId": "packs",
      "segmentIndex": 1,
      "text_sha256": "25ff5397f5210d1c8e9449b15f98530822eb48bce56496bf3de368cb5665c418"
    },
    {
      "text": "Si un pack manque, réimporte-le depuis cette page. Le rugby reste le même ; chacun met ses couleurs sur le carnet.",
      "textSha256": "3648697b9ba2b254ed79ff22c1814bc397f188a878da58958a909405be5313f8",
      "sha256": "b13e0662294619fa2265e9f839b1b0969b7dd7ee80978becbfd09b26c54e731b",
      "file": "packs-02.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 9.2,
      "sampleRate": 24000,
      "channels": 1,
      "generationSeconds": 16.92,
      "peakBeforeNormalization": 0.65234375,
      "seed": 271108,
      "id": "packs-02",
      "pageId": "packs",
      "segmentIndex": 2,
      "text_sha256": "3648697b9ba2b254ed79ff22c1814bc397f188a878da58958a909405be5313f8"
    },
    {
      "text": "Avant de chercher un grand nom, cherche ce qui manque à ton équipe. Regarde la couverture des postes et les fins de contrat. Une piste te plaît ?",
      "textSha256": "06f1768ee58ccdcf5a806ab90e606947c452e0d4d69e1e05860d66e5b914eb79",
      "sha256": "4df4d406bb9ce1a81d147bde97eac653f7b09f1e036a49068e9cf9943a9960cb",
      "file": "recrutement-01.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 10.16,
      "sampleRate": 24000,
      "channels": 1,
      "generationSeconds": 17.34,
      "peakBeforeNormalization": 0.85546875,
      "seed": 271108,
      "id": "recrutement-01",
      "pageId": "recrutement",
      "segmentIndex": 1,
      "text_sha256": "06f1768ee58ccdcf5a806ab90e606947c452e0d4d69e1e05860d66e5b914eb79"
    },
    {
      "text": "Lis le salaire, la durée et le coût avant de proposer. Une contre-offre, ça se discute ; une promesse, ça se tient. Et une proposition n'est pas encore une signature.",
      "textSha256": "2975e833a55c99d1b30404a1ab7dcac8bb7e648d20b679c018f29c072a9ffff0",
      "sha256": "35d0f8e2e145a1e9a5fee5198dcd693bba6571da048f6415c7eee1dc2e50e777",
      "file": "recrutement-02.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 12.56,
      "sampleRate": 24000,
      "channels": 1,
      "generationSeconds": 19.37,
      "peakBeforeNormalization": 0.7421875,
      "seed": 271108,
      "id": "recrutement-02",
      "pageId": "recrutement",
      "segmentIndex": 2,
      "text_sha256": "2975e833a55c99d1b30404a1ab7dcac8bb7e648d20b679c018f29c072a9ffff0"
    },
    {
      "text": "Regarde un peu autour de nous. Un club, c'est une ville, un stade et des gens qui reviennent, même sous la pluie.",
      "textSha256": "443f8021c117ed49467507ee45c4e3b0ed716558a488298d2feb0fa449f29008",
      "sha256": "50d103b0c68fd91fa66d79176758fd6a5cead7437fdf31eeaa91983081e82445",
      "file": "territoire-01.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 7.76,
      "sampleRate": 24000,
      "channels": 1,
      "generationSeconds": 11.49,
      "peakBeforeNormalization": 0.7734375,
      "seed": 271108,
      "id": "territoire-01",
      "pageId": "territoire",
      "segmentIndex": 1,
      "text_sha256": "443f8021c117ed49467507ee45c4e3b0ed716558a488298d2feb0fa449f29008"
    },
    {
      "text": "Ces photos d'archive donnent un visage au territoire ; leurs crédits sont accessibles ici. Les murs ne gagnent pas les matchs, d'accord. Mais savoir pour qui on joue, ça compte.",
      "textSha256": "b0e4fe194ce52ff818981acec2bc5a8adef701bdf7cc9ab34c3b7b12e10a8f0b",
      "sha256": "6d2e9aedd73b2ca71ad3b61d4af55a2470b0ee596783c965f9bdfde0d705b478",
      "file": "territoire-02.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 11.6,
      "sampleRate": 24000,
      "channels": 1,
      "generationSeconds": 16.26,
      "peakBeforeNormalization": 0.7265625,
      "seed": 271108,
      "id": "territoire-02",
      "pageId": "territoire",
      "segmentIndex": 2,
      "text_sha256": "b0e4fe194ce52ff818981acec2bc5a8adef701bdf7cc9ab34c3b7b12e10a8f0b"
    },
    {
      "text": "Le rugby, ça ne se fait pas seul. L'adjoint peut préparer la feuille ; le préparateur, choisir la charge. Les délégations restent tes décisions.",
      "textSha256": "5660a55a4f3805dc9a82ab0cd27277f9c598a9cfd6623cc2908d203e749ec151",
      "sha256": "7d1e3427ea35bd036d0f29fbb4704e0ff8a0dd62e799f34d8eb8a6f9b2578ecc",
      "file": "staff-01.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 10.56,
      "sampleRate": 24000,
      "channels": 1,
      "generationSeconds": 15.97,
      "peakBeforeNormalization": 0.70703125,
      "seed": 271108,
      "id": "staff-01",
      "pageId": "staff",
      "segmentIndex": 1,
      "text_sha256": "5660a55a4f3805dc9a82ab0cd27277f9c598a9cfd6623cc2908d203e749ec151"
    },
    {
      "text": "Ici, tu peux aussi consulter les visages et les fonctions des staffs de chaque club. Regarde leurs dates de référence : cet annuaire ne simule pas leurs changements de club.",
      "textSha256": "70a5e68976cc789d6b8ced0c1844bc6e74d90e7eb6f3b853f66cc0f3335de62a",
      "sha256": "c877b23cf3e40d988cb375891726358ae4bd2b93dee00887cd3cc604a36fc5b5",
      "file": "staff-02.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 10.56,
      "sampleRate": 24000,
      "channels": 1,
      "generationSeconds": 15.96,
      "peakBeforeNormalization": 0.75,
      "seed": 271108,
      "id": "staff-02",
      "pageId": "staff",
      "segmentIndex": 2,
      "text_sha256": "70a5e68976cc789d6b8ced0c1844bc6e74d90e7eb6f3b853f66cc0f3335de62a"
    },
    {
      "text": "Quinze espoirs arrivent au centre chaque saison. Regarde leur poste, leur potentiel estimé et leur travail avant de promouvoir.",
      "textSha256": "91494a6d04a5d460563bb96490c5759b8b96efa6ac39ae468e6f8a2f68f0e800",
      "sha256": "91fb539e2d8531ca631b6ec29884727bf8f8b286e6c10e58d5b6ca5f7a220e36",
